=2 Walkthrough
* Zone into {z:Bastok Markets (S)} from {z:North Gustaberg (S)} for a cutscene that begins the quest. You will receive the {@k}{k:Silvermine key}.
* Go to {z:North Gustaberg (S)} top-middle of (E-9) and examine the **Stonehoused Adit** for a cutscene.
** {p:Survival Guide} or Allied Notes Teleport via {n:Scarlette, C.A.}, {n:Narkissa, C.A.}, or {n:Wenonah, C.A.} is fastest if you have access.
* Examine the **Stonehoused Adit** again to start the fight.
** If you fail this fight, you can get a new Silvermine key by speaking with {n:Solitary Ant} at {z:North Gustaberg (S)} (J-9).
** You must zone and wait a game day before getting a new key.
* Your goal is to protect the NPC as you run through a maze. At certain points Quadavs will attack the NPC.
** The Quadav are level 66-70 and have 1500-2000 HP
** The NPC will follow the path marked below.
*** See the {p:Discussion|Talk:Fire in the Hole} tab for enemy attack patterns
** Occasionally the Quadavs will lose hate on whomever they are attacking and go after the NPC.
** You can cure the NPC via non-BLU spells and she can be buffed by most spells

\**WARNING:** **{c=red:This mission may be very difficult to solo without AoE sleep and/or damage.}** Valaineral's Trust will reliably Uriel Blade each group of Quadavs so long as your initial attack to activate Trusts does not immediately defeat the target.
* Once you defeat all of the Quadavs, the battlefield will end once Adelheid reaches the turret.
* Enter {z:Bastok Markets (S)} from {z:North Gustaberg (S)} for a cutscene.
* Speak to {p:Gentle Tiger|Gentle Tiger (S)} in {z:Bastok Markets (S)} (H-6) for a cutscene.
* Speak to {p:Gentle Tiger|Gentle Tiger (S)} again for a second cutscene and to receive your reward.

!Ruhotz Silvermines (Fire in the Hole).jpg||
